<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="3284c7e8">&lt;h3&gt;
    When to apply this practice
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    This capability should be applied in any engagement where&amp;nbsp;standard, medium-scale, project management work is
    involved. This should not be confused with engagement service quality management.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;
    Getting started
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    If you are generally not familiar with this capability, please navigate through its welcome page contents and the
    Project Management method navigation pane to see how tasks, work products and guidance from this capability are
    integrated.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;
    Common pitfalls
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    This capability is solely for very small projects and engagement teams, please scale and match the appropriate project
    management delivery process with the client service needs for the engagement.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
